<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83931" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόκᾰμ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lock</i> or <i>braid of hair,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				6
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				187
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.34
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>locks, curling hair,</i> prop. of women, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.176
			</span></i>; of a man, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κομᾶν πλόκαμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.82
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Τυφῶ,</span> dithyrambic
			phrase in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				336
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί πλόκαμοι ῥέξωμεν, ὅτ᾽ οὔρεα τοῖα
					σιδήρῳ εἴκουσιν;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
				</span></i>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				9.1092.47
			</span></i>: in sg. also, collectively, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				313
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχὸς π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					564
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίτας π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					309
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βερενίκης π.,</span> a constellation, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. Call.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ π. συστροφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεκτάνη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. θαυμαστός,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλέγμα δικτυοειδές</span>
			, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				9.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in pl., of
			wicker <i>baskets,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Nat.Fac.</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>.</div>
